---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Experience | Jeyson Andrés Mueses">
  <section class="animate">
    <span class="section-label" data-t="experience_label">[08] Experience</span>
    <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px;" data-t="experience_title">Work Experience</h2>

    <div class="items-list">
      <div class="item" style="flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 4px; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
        <div class="item-header">
          <span style="font-weight: 500;">Cloud & DevOps Engineer</span>
          <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-secondary);">2023 — Present</span>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);">Corporación Favorita · Quito, Ecuador</span>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.7;">Architecting and automating cloud infrastructure on AWS and Azure using Terraform and Docker. Implemented automated CI/CD deployment pipelines with GitHub Actions, accelerating release cycles from days to under 15 minutes. Managed Kubernetes clusters (EKS), container orchestration, and established centralized observability using Prometheus and Grafana for critical production workloads.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="item" style="flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 4px; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
        <div class="item-header">
          <span style="font-weight: 500;">Junior Cloud & Infrastructure Engineer</span>
          <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-secondary);">2022 — 2023</span>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);">Banco Pichincha · Quito, Ecuador</span>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.7;">Supported the infrastructure and platform engineering team in migrating on-premise systems to hybrid cloud environments. Automated system administration tasks, Linux server hardening, and containerization with Docker. Maintained database reliability, backup automation, and monitoring across microservices.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="item" style="flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 4px; padding: 16px 0;">
        <div class="item-header">
          <span style="font-weight: 500;">DevOps & Systems Administrator Intern</span>
          <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-secondary);">2021 — 2022</span>
        </div>
        <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);">Freelance · Remote</span>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.7;">Delivered infrastructure provisioning, Linux server configuration, and web deployment pipelines for 4 SMEs. Configured Nginx reverse proxies, SSL/TLS automation, and automated backup workflows using Bash scripts and Docker Compose.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <a href="/portfolio" class="nav-link" style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none;" data-t="back_home"><i data-lucide="arrow-left"></i> Back to Home</a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
